#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0696 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "No SPDEVID column, so detection stops at plain BDS and the [MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE] scope rejects -> skip (K3-01 AD0691 precedent: SPDEVID is the device discriminator column). Two Y rows in one group would otherwise fire."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col BASETYPE type=Char
col ABLFL    type=Char
col AVAL     type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | GLUC | LAST | Y | 100
S1 | 001 | GLUC | LAST | Y | 105
